<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>txtpack</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>txtpack</h1>
  <form method="post" action="/pack">
    <label for="modules">Modules (one per line)</label><br>
    <textarea id="modules" name="modules" rows="12" cols="60" required></textarea><br>
    <button type="submit">Install and pack</button>
  </form>
  <p>The finished script is written to <code>public/txtpack-$jobid</code> and available for download from <code>/txtpack-$jobid</code>.</p>
  <p>Jobs are processed by a Minion worker. Start one with <code>./txtpack.pl minion worker</code>.</p>
</body>
</html>
